{"id":271,"title":"查找数组出现1次的数字","summary":"在一个已排序且有重复数字的数组中寻找出现次数1次的数字，难度：中等。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"027ab564439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 问题\n\n假设有一个已**排序**数组，该数组只由**整数组成**且每个数字都出现**两次**，但只有一个数字出现**一次**。请找出只出现一次的数字。\n\n**限制条件：**\n\n- $1 \\leq nums.length \\leq 10^3$\n- $0 \\leq nums[i] \\leq 10^3$\n\n**例子1：**\n\n```\nInput: [1,1,2,3,3,4,4,8,8]    \nOutput: 2\n```\n\n**例子2：**\n\n```\nInput: [3,3,7,7,10,11,11]    \nOutput: 10\n```\n\n**例子3：**\n\n```\nInput: [1,1,2,2,3]    \nOutput: 3\n```\n\n**例子4：**\n\n```\nInput: [1]    \nOutput: 1\n```","text_html":"<h2>问题</h2>\n<p>假设有一个已<strong>排序</strong>数组，该数组只由<strong>整数组成</strong>且每个数字都出现<strong>两次</strong>，但只有一个数字出现<strong>一次</strong>。请找出只出现一次的数字。</p>\n<p><strong>限制条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 \\leq nums.length \\leq 10^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141079999999999em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1.008548em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">h</span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 \\leq nums[i] \\leq 10^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141079999999999em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1.064108em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>例子1：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>Input: [1,1,2,3,3,4,4,8,8]    \nOutput: 2\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>例子2：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>Input: [3,3,7,7,10,11,11]    \nOutput: 10\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>例子3：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>Input: [1,1,2,2,3]    \nOutput: 3\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>例子4：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>Input: [1]    \nOutput: 1\n</code></pre>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"027ab87a439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 思路\n\n由于该数组包含一个只出现一次的数字，而所有其他数字都出现两次，所以该数字出现次数是奇数。","text_html":"<h2>思路</h2>\n<p>由于该数组包含一个只出现一次的数字，而所有其他数字都出现两次，所以该数字出现次数是奇数。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"027ab8f2439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 算法\n\n- $left$设为$0$，$right$为$nums$的大小。\n\n-  While $left + 1 < right$:\n\n    - 以 $mid = \\frac{(left + right)}{2}$ 作为猜测。比较$nums[mid]$和$nums[mid - 1]$：\n\n        - If $nums[mid]$ !=$nums[mid - 1]$并且$(1 + mid$ ==$nums.length$ 或$nums[mid]$ !=$nums[mid + 1])$，则返回$nums[mid]$。\n\n        - Else if $(mid$ 是奇数 且 $nums[mid] == nums[mid - 1])$，或$(mid$是偶数 且$nums[mid] == nums[mid + 1])$，移动左边界$left = mid$。\n\n        -  Else, 移动右边界$right = mid$。\n\n- Return $nums[left]$.\n","text_html":"<h2>算法</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">left</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span></span></span></span>设为<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">right</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span></span></span></span>为<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nums</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span></span></span></span>的大小。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>While <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">left + 1 &lt; right</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span></span></span></span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>以 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mid = \\frac{(left + right)}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1.355em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord reset-textstyle textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size5 size5 reset-textstyle textstyle uncramped nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.345em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.22999999999999998em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle textstyle uncramped frac-line\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.485em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size5 size5 reset-textstyle textstyle uncramped nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 作为猜测。比较<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nums[mid]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>和<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nums[mid - 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>If <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nums[mid]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span> !=<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nums[mid - 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>并且<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1 + mid</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span></span></span></span> ==<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nums.length</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">h</span></span></span></span> 或<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nums[mid]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span> !=<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nums[mid + 1])</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>，则返回<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nums[mid]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Else if <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(mid</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span></span></span></span> 是奇数 且 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nums[mid] == nums[mid - 1])</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>，或<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(mid</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span></span></span></span>是偶数 且<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nums[mid] == nums[mid + 1])</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>，移动左边界<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">left = mid</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Else, 移动右边界<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">right = mid</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Return <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nums[left]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"027ab938439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 编码\n\n以下是代码:","text_html":"<h2>编码</h2>\n<p>以下是代码:</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":3},{"type":"TabbedCode","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"027ab97e439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","caption":"","code_contents":[{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_0_027ab97e439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","title":"C++","caption":"","language":"c++","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.cpp","content":"#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint singleNonDuplicate(vector<int>& nums) {\n  // 左索引的初始值为 0\n  int left = 0;\n  // 右索引的初始值是数组中元素的数量\n  int right = nums.size();\n  // left + 1 >= right 将完成 while 循环\n  while (left + 1 < right) {\n    int mid = (right + left) / 2;\n      \n    if (nums[mid] != nums[mid - 1] && (1 + mid == nums.size() || nums[mid] != nums[mid + 1])) {\n      // 中间索引上的元素就是答案\n      return nums[mid];\n    } else if (((mid % 2) != 0 && nums[mid] == nums[mid - 1]) || ((mid % 2) == 0 && nums[mid] == nums[mid + 1])) {\n      // 在数组的左半部分搜索是没有意义的\n      left = mid;\n    } else {\n      // 在数组的右半部分搜索没有意义\n      right = mid;\n    }\n  }\n  // 左边索引的元素就是答案\n  return nums[left];\n}\n\nint main() {\n  vector<int> nums1 = {1,1,2,3,3,4,4,8,8};\n  vector<int> nums2 = {3,3,7,7,10,11,11};\n  vector<int> nums3 = {1,1,2,2,3};\n  vector<int> nums4 = {1};\n\n  cout << \"The single element is ---> \"  << singleNonDuplicate(nums1) << endl;\n  cout << \"The single element is ---> \"  << singleNonDuplicate(nums2) << endl;\n  cout << \"The single element is ---> \"  << singleNonDuplicate(nums3) << endl;\n  cout << \"The single element is ---> \"  << singleNonDuplicate(nums4) << endl;\n\n  return 0;\n}","time_limit":30,"allow_download":true,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_1_027ab97e439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","title":"Java","caption":"二分有序数组","language":"java","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.java","content":"class Solution {\n  int singleNonDuplicate(int[] nums) {\n    // 左索引的初始值为 0\n    int left = 0;\n    // 右索引的初始值是数组中元素的数量\n    int right = nums.length;\n    // left + 1 >= right 将完成 while 循环\n    while (left + 1 < right) {\n      int mid = (right + left) / 2;\n      \n      if (nums[mid] != nums[mid - 1] && (1 + mid == nums.length || nums[mid] != nums[mid + 1])) {\n        // 中间索引上的元素就是答案\n        return nums[mid];\n      } else if (((mid % 2) != 0 && nums[mid] == nums[mid - 1]) || ((mid % 2) == 0 && nums[mid] == nums[mid + 1])) {\n        // 在数组的左半部分搜索是没有意义的\n        left = mid;\n      } else {\n        // 在数组的右半部分搜索没有意义\n        right = mid;\n      }\n    }\n    // 左边索引的元素就是答案\n    return nums[left];\n  }\n\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Solution sol = new Solution();\n    int[] nums1 = new int[] {1,1,2,3,3,4,4,8,8};\n    int[] nums2 = new int[] {3,3,7,7,10,11,11};\n    int[] nums3 = new int[] {1,1,2,2,3};\n    int[] nums4 = new int[] {1};\n\n    System.out.println(\"The single element is ---> \" + sol.singleNonDuplicate(nums1));\n    System.out.println(\"The single element is ---> \" + sol.singleNonDuplicate(nums2));\n    System.out.println(\"The single element is ---> \" + sol.singleNonDuplicate(nums3));\n    System.out.println(\"The single element is ---> \" + sol.singleNonDuplicate(nums4));\n  }\n}","time_limit":30,"allow_download":true,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"","append_code":"","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_2_027ab97e439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","title":"JavaScript","caption":"二分有序数组","language":"javascript","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"index.js","content":"const singleNonDuplicate = function(nums) {\n  // 左索引的初始值为 0\n  let left = 0;\n  // 右索引的初始值是数组中元素的数量\n  let right = nums.length;\n  // left + 1 >= right 将完成 while 循环\n  while (left + 1 < right) {\n    const mid = Math.floor((right + left) / 2);\n    \n    if (nums[mid] !== nums[mid - 1] && (1 + mid === nums.length || nums[mid] !== nums[mid + 1])) {\n      // 中间索引上的元素就是答案\n      return nums[mid];\n    } else if (((mid % 2) !== 0 && nums[mid] === nums[mid - 1]) || ((mid % 2) === 0 && nums[mid] === nums[mid + 1])) {\n      // 在数组的左半部分搜索是没有意义的\n      left = mid;\n    } else {\n      // 在数组的右半部分搜索没有意义\n      right = mid;\n    }\n  }\n  // 左边索引的元素就是答案\n  return nums[left];\n}\n\nconsole.log(`The single element is ---> ${singleNonDuplicate([1,1,2,3,3,4,4,8,8])}`);\nconsole.log(`The single element is ---> ${singleNonDuplicate([3,3,7,7,10,11,11])}`);\nconsole.log(`The single element is ---> ${singleNonDuplicate([1,1,2,2,3])}`);\nconsole.log(`The single element is ---> ${singleNonDuplicate([1])}`);","time_limit":30,"allow_download":true,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"","append_code":"","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_3_027ab97e439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","title":"Python","caption":"二分有序数组","language":"python3","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"def singleNonDuplicate(nums):\n  # 左索引的初始值为 0\n  left = 0\n  # 右索引的初始值是数组中元素的数量\n  right = len(nums)\n  # left + 1 >= right 时将完成while循环\n  while left + 1 < right:\n    mid = (right + left) // 2\n    \n    if nums[mid] != nums[mid - 1] and (1 + mid == len(nums) or nums[mid] != nums[mid + 1]):\n      # 中间索引上的元素就是答案\n      return nums[mid]\n    elif ((mid % 2) != 0 and nums[mid] == nums[mid - 1]) or ((mid % 2) == 0 and nums[mid] == nums[mid + 1]):\n      # 在数组的左半部分搜索没有意义\n      left = mid\n    else:\n      # 在数组的右半部分搜索没有意义\n      right = mid\n  # 左边索引的元素就是答案\n  return nums[left]\n\ndef main():\n  print(\"The single element is ---> \" + str(singleNonDuplicate([1,1,2,3,3,4,4,8,8])))\n  print(\"The single element is ---> \" + str(singleNonDuplicate([3,3,7,7,10,11,11])))\n  print(\"The single element is ---> \" + str(singleNonDuplicate([1,1,2,2,3])))\n  print(\"The single element is ---> \" + str(singleNonDuplicate([1])))\n\nmain()","time_limit":30,"allow_download":true,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"","append_code":"","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null}],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":4},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"027ab9c4439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 复杂度\n\n- **时间复杂度**: $O(log_2\\space n)$\n- **空间复杂度**: $O(1)$","text_html":"<h2>复杂度</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(log_2\\space n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mord mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"027aba0a439711ecbe523af9d3c2d1d5","text":"\n----\n\n这是课程中的最后一个问题👏。\n\n请继续下一课测试下二分查找算法的掌握情况。","text_html":"<hr />\n<p>这是课程中的最后一个问题👏。</p>\n<p>请继续下一课测试下二分查找算法的掌握情况。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"ed